{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Horizon: Mars is a simplistic, yet strategic Mars colonization simulator, where you make decisions that impact humanities last hope. Set in the distant future, it is up to you to instate a government, promote laws, and manage your colony in Mars. Choose your destiny - do you succeed in turning Mars into a succesful, habitable planet? Do you turn Mars into a technological superpower? That is your choice to make when playing RHM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ideologies to take lead of your colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of decisions to make for the good of Mars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laws you must enact and use to better your planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics such as planet happiness and crime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform Mars, and turn it into the habitable planet suitable for humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is in very early stages, so updates will be frequent and you can expect lot's of graphical and gameplay changes to come soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448570/f443caf662f9b6b7364608d5a008a757f81559a9.jpg"},{"name":"A Technological Government","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448570/9f4621569ff864ffd166495cbf5edf04fc2eb30d.jpg"},{"name":"A Greener Mars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448570/8d58b5e7f63e157ea96631efbfa40492c8247b83.jpg"},{"name":"An Individualist Planet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima