st hope. Set in the distant future, it is up to you to instate a government, promote laws, and manage your colony in Mars. Choose your destiny - do you succeed in turning Mars into a succesful, habitable planet? Do you turn Mars into a technological superpower? That is your choice to make when playing RHM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ideologies to take lead of your colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of decisions to make for the good of Mars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laws you must enact and use to better your planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics such as planet happiness and crime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform Mars, and turn it into the habitable planet suitable for humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is in very early stages, so updates will be frequent and you can expect lot's of graphical and gameplay changes to come soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Newave Technologies","Matas Wasilewski"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448570/header.jpg?t=1742677284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448570/815222/f40c349bbc195d00becd080b34a0f9d5dcc4da73/1750852155/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737389036","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448570/815222/f40c349bbc195d00becd080b34a0f9d5dcc4da73/1750852155/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737389036","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"ht